SUMMARY:Afterschool Acting on Stage Presents: "A Sally Brown Christmas" (Grades 3–8)
DESCRIPTION:This class is SOLD OUT. To join a waitlist\, email education@schulzmuseum.org. Spend 12 weeks exploring theater arts and preparing to perform in a live performance of the original play\, A Sally Brown Christmas. Advance registration required.
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/afterschool-acting-on-stage-presents-a-sally-brown-christmas-grades-3-8-2/
CATEGORIES:Calendar of Events,Classes & Camps
END:VEVENT
