X-SOURCE:Charles M. Schulz Museum
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260912T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260912T170000
DTSTAMP:20260715T171652Z
CREATED:20260714T174504Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260715T171652Z
UID:10004548-1789207200-1789232400@schulzmuseum.org
SUMMARY:FREE DAY!
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy free admission all day. From 11:00 am–1:00 pm\, meet cartoonists Sequoia Blankenship and Rob Thompson as they share their debut graphic novel\, Feo the Chupacabra. Also\, experiment with basic printmaking with Arion Press.
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/free-day-2/
CATEGORIES:Calendar of Events
END:VEVENT
