SUMMARY:Celebrating Christo and Jeanne Claude’s Running Fence
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the 50th anniversary of Christo and Jeanne Claude’s Running Fence with a screening of the 1977 Academy Award-nominated documentary Running Fence\, followed by a discussion and Q&A with special guests.
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/celebrating-running-fence/
CATEGORIES:Calendar of Events
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Charles M. Schulz Museum
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T210000
