CREATED:20260716T160352Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260902T190506Z
UID:10004567-1790443800-1790456400@schulzmuseum.org
SUMMARY:Kids Night at the Museum: Happiness is a Warm Blanket
DESCRIPTION:Drop kids off for after-hours fun\, including pizza\, games\, crafts\, and cartooning! Get as cozy as Linus in his blanket with soft and fluffy-themed crafts and activities while exploring the Museum’s newest exhibition\, Blanket Statements: The Philosophies of Linus. Recommended for ages 5-10. Advance registration required.
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/kids-night-at-the-museum-31/
CATEGORIES:Calendar of Events
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Charles M. Schulz Museum
