LAST-MODIFIED:20260226T004624Z
UID:10003046-1790589600-1790596800@schulzmuseum.org
SUMMARY:Museum Mondays for Little Ones: Happiness is a Warm Blanket
DESCRIPTION:On the last Monday of the month\, enjoy stories\, crafts\, and activities designed for children ages 1-5 and their caregivers. This month\, celebrate the most sincere Peanuts character\, Linus\, by decorating your own security blanket\, fingerpainting a baseball\, and crafting a pom-pom pumpkin patch to welcome the Great Pumpkin! Also\, explore the Museum’s newest exhibition about Linus.
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/museum-mondays-for-little-ones-happiness-is-a-warm-blanket/
CATEGORIES:Calendar of Events
END:VEVENT
