SUMMARY:It’s the Great Pumpkin 60th Anniversary Event
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the 60th anniversary of the classic Peanuts holiday special\, It’s the Great Pumpkin\, Charlie Brown\, with special guests\, live music\, crafts\, and costume and mustache contests!
