UID:10003047-1793008800-1793016000@schulzmuseum.org
SUMMARY:Museum Mondays for Little Ones: Trick-or-Treat\, Charlie Brown!
DESCRIPTION:On the last Monday of the month\, enjoy stories\, crafts\, and activities designed for children ages 1-5 and their caregivers. This month\, dress in costume and trick-or-treat all around the Museum! Enjoy crafts\, stories\, and a screening of It’s the Great Pumpkin\, Charlie Brown on the big screen in the Museum theater. Decorate a colorful monster wreath\, bead a silly spider\, and paint with mallets. Trick-or-treating starts at 11:00 am.
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/museum-mondays-for-little-ones-trick-or-treat-charlie-brown/
CATEGORIES:Calendar of Events
END:VEVENT
