UID:10004566-1793786400-1793795400@schulzmuseum.org
SUMMARY:Homeschool Day: Good Grief! The Science of Expression
DESCRIPTION:Explore the science behind communication. Make your own pen and ink\, engineer an old-fashioned telephone\, and experiment with printmaking. Also\, extend the day with ice skating at Snoopy’s Home Ice from 12:30-2:00 pm.
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/homeschool-day-good-grief-the-science-of-expression/
CATEGORIES:Calendar of Events,Homeschool Days
END:VEVENT
